# Project Always Rules

## Never commit
- `.env` — secrets
- `agent-context/` (gitignored)

## Branch naming
`feat/[ticket-id]` · `fix/[ticket-id]` · `chore/[description]`

## API
Respect customer/provider/admin/shared route split. Validate inputs. Use errorHandler.

## Docs
Update `BACKEND_API.md` / Postman when adding endpoints.

## Product expectations
- The backend is the source of truth for business state.
- Preserve backward compatibility unless the task explicitly includes a contract change.
- Be careful with multi-role users, collaboration, and contact privacy.

## PR size
Prefer PRs under ~400 lines changed.
